==English==
{{wp}}

===Etymology===
From {{inh|en|enm|plowgh-schare}}, {{m|enm|plowh schare}}, equivalent to {{com|en|plow|share}}. Cognate with {{cog|stq|Plouchskoar|t=ploughshare}}, {{cog|fy|ploechskaar|t=ploughshare}}, {{cog|nl|ploegschaar|t=ploughshare}}, {{cog|nds-de|Ploogschoor|t=ploughshare}}, {{cog|de|Pflugschar|t=ploughshare}}, {{cog|da|plovskær|t=ploughshare}}, {{cog|no|plogskjær|t=ploughshare}}. 

Eclipsed non-native {{ncog|enm|culter|t=ploughshare}}, from {{ncog|ang|culter|t=ploughshare, coulter, dagger}}, borrowed from {{ncog|la|culter|t=knife, razor}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{audio|en|LL-Q1860 (eng)-Flame, not lame-plowshare.wav|a=US}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

